          "request": "What information is needed to apply for a personal loan?",
          "response": "To apply for a personal loan at VinBank, you’ll typically need to provide the following:\n\n- **Personal Identification**: Full legal name, date of birth, and either your Social Security Number or driver’s license number.\n- **Contact Information**: Current residential and/or business addresses, phone number, and email address.\n- **Employment & Income Details**: Source of income, approximate monthly earnings, and employment status.\n- **Credit History**: Recent credit card statements or loan applications to help assess eligibility.\n- **Loan Purpose**: The intended use of the funds (e.g., mortgage, car purchase, education).\n- **Additional Documentation** (if requested): Proof of identity, proof of income, and possibly tax returns.\n\nFor the most accurate and up-to-date list of documents and forms, please visit the “Loans” section on our website or schedule an appointment at a local branch.",
