          "request": "How can I replace a lost credit card?",
          "response": "To replace a lost credit card with VinBank:\n\n1. **Contact Support**: Call our 24/7 helpline at **1-800-VIN-BANK** or log in to your online banking securely.\n2. **Verify Identity**: Provide your full name, date of birth, and account number to confirm ownership.\n3. **Request Replacement**: Indicate that your card has been lost/stolen. We may send a temporary alternative using your saved payment details while processing the new card.\n4. **Issue New Card**: After verification, we’ll mail and deliver a new physical card along with a digital version, updating your billing address and contact info.\n\nIf you need help setting up new security codes or reporting the loss officially, let me know—I’m here to assist!",
